Defence Minister Rajnath Singh, addressing the DRDO–Industry Synergy Meet ‘VIMARSH 2026’ in Delhi, highlighted drones, artificial intelligence and cyber security as key areas for future warfare. He urged startups to identify opportunities, accelerate innovation and strengthen India’s technological and strategic capabilities. 

